# PREMIUM DEEPAVALI CRACKERS BUSINESS WEBSITE
## COMPLETE FUNCTIONAL BUILD SPECIFICATION

Build a complete premium Deepavali crackers e-commerce website for a real Indian fireworks retail business.

This is intended to become a REAL BUSINESS WEBSITE.

Do not build a simple landing page.

Do not build a static UI mockup.

Do not create fake buttons that do nothing.

Do not create a generic AI-looking website.

Build a functional customer shopping experience and a functional admin/business management system.

The website should be designed to increase customer engagement, make product discovery enjoyable, reduce friction in ordering, and make it extremely easy for customers to send their complete order to the business through WhatsApp.

The website must be mobile-first because many customers will access it through mobile phones and WhatsApp.

The first version can use demo data, but the architecture must be ready to connect to a real database, real WhatsApp Business integration, and real payment processing later.

============================================================
PART 1 — BUSINESS OBJECTIVE
============================================================

The business sells Deepavali crackers/fireworks.

The website's primary purpose is NOT to process a traditional online checkout immediately.

The primary customer journey is:

CUSTOMER VISITS WEBSITE
        ↓
DISCOVERS CRACKERS
        ↓
UNDERSTANDS WHAT EACH CRACKER DOES
        ↓
SEES PRICE
        ↓
ADDS PRODUCTS TO CART
        ↓
REVIEWS CART
        ↓
ENTERS CONTACT / DELIVERY DETAILS
        ↓
CREATES ORDER
        ↓
COMPLETE ORDER DETAILS ARE SENT TO BUSINESS WHATSAPP
        ↓
BUSINESS REVIEWS ORDER
        ↓
BUSINESS CONFIRMS AVAILABILITY
        ↓
BUSINESS SENDS PAYMENT INSTRUCTIONS
        ↓
CUSTOMER PAYS
        ↓
BUSINESS CONFIRMS PAYMENT
        ↓
ORDER IS PREPARED
        ↓
DELIVERY / PICKUP

The website should make this flow feel effortless.

